## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
**Part A — Why This Company Can Compound:**  
Azure growth → increases market share → drives switching costs → reinforces customer lock-in → boosts pricing power → reinvests in R&D for innovation → accelerates Azure adoption.  
This virtuous cycle ensures MSFT’s cloud dominance and recurring revenue streams. **Durability Verdict:** High — structural advantages are self-reinforcing.

